{"content": {"exact_text": "Yet, its complexity questions its applicability in practical settings.", "field": "traffic.author_stated_limitations", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:54.300178Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "limitation", "id": "E0009", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212450Z_6ae3ce96", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0003-1", "bbox": {"x0": 53.37, "x1": 295.56, "y0": 370.13, "y1": 477.7}, "block": "B0028", "char_end": 419, "char_start": 349, "file_hash": "sha256:c377e34b718ee04c35a2350c5155d546e82aa0f310f84739a55b379d171ce26e", "page": 1, "section_path": ["Abstract"], "text_hash": "sha256:4e9079c1e2c1bf7dff15ae6b936c0d53187a386f9814dd971fd1bcb889f437aa", "version": "V0003-1", "work": "W0003"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:38.940587Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The authors state this limitation of their own model.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:38.940570Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "we demonstrate that the reported successes are heavily influenced by data preparation problems, which allow these models to find easy shortcuts – spurious correlation between features and labels – during fine-tuning that unrealistically boost their performance", "field": "traffic.author_stated_limitations", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:54.302799Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "author_conclusion", "id": "E0010", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212450Z_6ae3ce96", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0003-1", "bbox": {"x0": 52.81, "x1": 295.56, "y0": 260.45, "y1": 368.13}, "block": "B0021", "char_end": 654, "char_start": 394, "file_hash": "sha256:c377e34b718ee04c35a2350c5155d546e82aa0f310f84739a55b379d171ce26e", "page": 1, "section_path": ["Abstract"], "text_hash": "sha256:9f30d7d7987211f961a8c801f61ac5ab0e0d50fe47f505c5f5206e615fe63a62", "version": "V0003-1", "work": "W0003"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:43.953579Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The abstract states this conclusion about the literature.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:37:43.953562Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "We also introduce Pcap-Encoder, an LMbased representation learning model that we specifically design to extract features from protocol headers.", "field": "traffic.representation_family", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:53.757706Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "representation_description", "id": "E0023", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212450Z_6ae3ce96", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0003-1", "bbox": {"x0": 53.37, "x1": 295.56, "y0": 370.13, "y1": 477.7}, "block": "B0028", "char_end": 233, "char_start": 90, "file_hash": "sha256:c377e34b718ee04c35a2350c5155d546e82aa0f310f84739a55b379d171ce26e", "page": 1, "section_path": ["Abstract"], "text_hash": "sha256:4e9079c1e2c1bf7dff15ae6b936c0d53187a386f9814dd971fd1bcb889f437aa", "version": "V0003-1", "work": "W0003"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:38:58.336779Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span states that the representation is built from protocol header fields.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:38:58.336759Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "When fine-tuned for traffic classification, they reach up to 98% accuracy on VPN or TLS-encrypted traces.", "field": "traffic.encryption_status", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:54.129888Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "experimental_setup", "id": "E0024", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212450Z_6ae3ce96", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": null, "review_tier": 2, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0003-1", "bbox": {"x0": 317.95, "x1": 558.86, "y0": 591.1, "y1": 643.83}, "block": "B0037", "char_end": 190, "char_start": 85, "file_hash": "sha256:c377e34b718ee04c35a2350c5155d546e82aa0f310f84739a55b379d171ce26e", "page": 1, "section_path": ["1 Introduction"], "text_hash": "sha256:5dff14ec01f80e6a935facd0c4352360821397fe768ba9e509ddc2ab2bcbd7a5", "version": "V0003-1", "work": "W0003"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:39:03.709543Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The span establishes that the traces are VPN or TLS encrypted.", "review_action": "accept", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:39:03.709524Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
{"content": {"exact_text": "Figure 1: Accuracy of classifiers evaluated (TLS-120 dataset, packet classification task).", "field": "traffic.traffic_unit", "negative_state": null, "numeric": null}, "created_at": "2026-09-02T21:24:53.663882Z", "decisions": [], "evidence_type": "method_description", "id": "E0034", "origin": "author_claimed", "provenance": {"actor": "scripted/scripted-1", "note": null, "run_id": "run_20260902T212450Z_6ae3ce96", "source": "model", "template_version": "1.0.0", "workflow": "interrogate"}, "qualification": "the span is a figure caption; it establishes the packet-level task for that figure, not necessarily for every experiment in the paper", "review_tier": 1, "schema_version": 1, "source": {"artifact": "A0003-1", "bbox": {"x0": 317.61, "x1": 559.3, "y0": 377.11, "y1": 429.92}, "block": "B0029", "char_end": 90, "char_start": 0, "file_hash": "sha256:c377e34b718ee04c35a2350c5155d546e82aa0f310f84739a55b379d171ce26e", "page": 1, "section_path": ["Abstract"], "text_hash": "sha256:1fc273ebeeee4a9f6c90ee4133a9919a225ff26f723dfe305d5d21cbb8875a4d", "version": "V0003-1", "work": "W0003"}, "stale": "fresh", "strength": "direct", "updated_at": "2026-09-02T21:39:58.207765Z", "verification": {"accepted_by": "human", "extractor": "scripted/scripted-1", "rationale": "The figure caption establishes the packet as the classified unit.", "review_action": "accept_with_qualification", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T21:39:58.207747Z", "status": "accepted", "verdict": "supported", "verifier": "scripted/scripted-1"}}
